// # MCP 2.9.2 Red Team Certification
//
// Logline: Walks the 8-dimensional REDTEAM Hilbert space, the 10 enforcer pillars, the 256-line cap, the import graph, and the capability-token audit on the post-refactor MCP service.
//
// Setup: Read-only. Every finding cites file:line. No fixes embedded — this is the certificate, not a patch.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Files in scope and 256-line sweep.
//   2. Import graph (transitive closure).
//   3. REDTEAM R1-R8 walk.
//   4. Enforcer 10-pillar sweep.
//   5. Capability-token audit.
//   6. Removed obsolete paths and fallbacks.
//   7. Three follow-ups: R5 runtime, R8 real SHA, Unix-socket transport.

# Scope (Post Follow-ups)

  ooda/mcp/mcp_session.oo        125 lines
  ooda/mcp/mcp_transport.oo      148 lines
  ooda/mcp/mcp_graph.oo          215 lines
  ooda/mcp/mcp_dispatch.oo       178 lines
  ooda/mcp/mcp_codex.oo           59 lines
  ooda/mcp/mcp_server.oo         172 lines
  ooda/safe_mcp_merge.oo         158 lines
  ooda/std/net/unix_socket.oo    100 lines
  ooda/cli/cmd_mcp.oo             65 lines
